  "case": "The readers are funders whom board members will meet about the sixth site. They must come to believe that Harborlight's adult learning works and that demand now outruns its five sites. The strongest proof is that enrollment rose from 936 to 1,148, with 287 adults still on the waitlist at year end, and that 68 percent of learners who stayed at least 12 weeks gained a reading level, at a cost of $1,237 per learner. Funders will ask what a sixth site adds and what it costs. Staff estimate it would serve 180 more learners a year, and the ask is the $190,000 increase from $1,420,000 to $1,610,000 to open the Eastgate site and add two site coordinators.",
